{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:b3b89c50c7f7cbaf55de012e68551bbe", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 7, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "I'll update the YAML first, then look at the revocation path.", "turn_key": "sha256:6312c6cdaa2267aa4e0f70658c56656b"}
